   "function": "explanation",
   "scene_type": "zlx_readout",
   "spoken": "The biggest difference is pressure. According to the engineering lecture, port injection works at three to seven bar, direct injection at fifty to two hundred and fifty. Bosch quotes up to three hundred and fifty bar for current systems.",
