  {
   "id": "b5",
   "function": "insight",
   "scene_type": "zlx_board",
   "spoken": "The lecture lists both sides for direct injection. The upside: the evaporating fuel cools the charge, which allows more compression. The downside: higher cost and more particulates, for example at full load and during a cold start. So it is a trade-off, not a free win.",
